<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-title>Panier abandonné - le Magasin du BTP</mj-title>
    <mj-font name="Roboto" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" />
    <mj-style>
      ul { padding-left: 15px; }
      @media all and (max-width: 767px) {
        body { padding:0 20px !important; }
        .mj-container {padding:0 10px !important; }
        .header-wrap > table > tbody > tr > td { padding-bottom: 32px !important; padding-top: 20px !important; }
        .logo >td > table >tbody > tr > td { width:150px !important;}
        .intro-wrap div  {font-size: 14px !important; line-height: 20px !important; }
        .header-img > table > tbody > tr > td{ padding-bottom: 20px !important; padding-top: 20px !important; padding-bottom: 0!important;}
        .content-title div{ font-size: 18px !important; line-height: 22px !important; }
        .content-title {padding-left: 32px !important; padding-right: 32px !important; padding-bottom: 20px !important;}
        .content-text {padding-left: 32px !important; padding-right: 32px !important; }
        .content-wrap > table > tbody > tr > td { padding-bottom: 30px !important; padding-top: 32px !important; }
        .contact-wrap > table > tbody > tr > td { padding-left: 0 !important; padding-right: 0 !important; }
        .contact-wrap td { border: 0 !important; }
        .content-wrap.content-text-info > table > tbody > tr > td { padding-top: 0 !important; padding-bottom: 32px !important;}
        .divider > table > tbody > tr > td{ padding-left: 8px !important; padding-right: 8px !important; padding-bottom: 15px !important; padding-top: 15px !important;}
        .footer-logo-wrap .mj-column-per-33 { width: 33% !important; text-align: center !important; }
        .footer-logo-wrap td  {  padding-left: 0 !important; padding-right: 0 !important; }
      }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  

  <mj-body background-color="#F3F3F3" width="660px">
      <!-- Header -->
      <mj-section background-color="#F3F3F3" padding-bottom="40px" padding-top="50px" css-class="header-wrap" >
        <mj-column width="100%" vertical-align="top" >
          <mj-image src="data:image/svg+xml;base64," alt="" align="center"  border="none" width="200px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="logo">
          </mj-image>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Content Text -->
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-bottom="25px" padding-top="40px" css-class="content-wrap">
        <mj-column width="100%" vertical-align="top">
          <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="600" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="20px" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px"  padding-bottom="20px" padding-top="0" css-class="content-title">
            Terminez votre achat et avancez sur votre projet
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text align="left" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16px" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text">
            <p>Bonjour Mathilde, </p>
            <p>On a remarqué que votre panier sur notre site LeMAGASINduBTP.com renferme des trésors qui ne demandent qu'à rejoindre votre boîte à outils pour réaliser des merveilles sur votre chantier.</p>
            <p>Jetez un coup d'œil rapide à ce que vous avez laissé derrière vous :</p> 
          </mj-text>
          <mj-table>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 10px; border: 2px solid #E7E7E7; vertical-align: middle; width:120px;">
                <img src="satisfait.webp" width="120"/>
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 10px; border: 2px solid #E7E7E7; vertical-align: middle; font-size:16px">
                <h4 style="font-size:18px!important; margin-top: 0 !important;">Ventouse vibrante VV 130 mm </h4> 
                <strong>240.28€ TTC</strong>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </mj-table>
          <mj-text align="left" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="16px" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text">
          <p style="text-align:center;">
            Sous-total : <strong>19,55 €</strong><br> 
            Frais de port : <strong>0,00 €</strong><br> 
            TVA : <strong>3,91 € </strong><br>
            <span style="color:#36687E !important;"><strong>Montant global : 23,46 €</strong></span>
            <p>
          </mj-text>
          <mj-button href="https://www.lemagasindubtp.com/" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" background-color="#fff" font-size="16px"  color="#BDBDBD" font-weight="600" border="1px solid #00add5" border-radius="4px">
            Acheter maintenant
          </mj-button>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

   <!-- Service -->
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="20px" css-class="contact-wrap" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text">
        <mj-column width="100%" vertical-align="middle" padding="0" >
          <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="600" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="20px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0"  padding-bottom="20px" padding-top="0" css-class="content-title">
            leMAGASINduBTP.com au cœur de vos besoins quotidiens !
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="25%" vertical-align="middle"  padding="0">
          <mj-image width="100px" src="sav.webp" padding="0" />
          <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text"  padding="0">
            SAV 100% garanti
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
         <mj-column width="25%" vertical-align="middle"  padding="0">
          <mj-image width="100px" src="client.webp" padding="0" />
          <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text"  padding="0">
            Service client 24/7
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
         <mj-column width="25%" vertical-align="middle"  padding="0">
          <mj-image width="100px" src="expedition.webp" padding="0" />
          <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text"  padding="0">
            Expédition rapide
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
         <mj-column width="25%" vertical-align="middle"  padding="0">
          <mj-image width="100px" src="satisfait.webp" padding="0" />
          <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="13px" padding-left="0" padding-right="0" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text"  padding="0">
            Satisfait ou remboursé
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Paiement -->
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="40px" css-class="contact-wrap" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text">
        <mj-column width="20%" vertical-align="middle" padding="0" >
            <mj-image width="90px" src="paiement.webp" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="80%" vertical-align="middle"  padding="0" border-left="1px solid #E7E7E7">
          <mj-text align="left" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="21px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" padding-left="20px" padding-right="20px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text"  padding="0">
            <p><strong>Trouvez le meilleur moyen de régler votre achat :</strong></p>
            <p>Que vous préfériez un paiement par virement, en plusieurs fois ou via Paypal... Nous avons le moyen de paiement sécurisé qui vous convient !</p> 
            <ul>
              <li>Carte bancaire</li>
              <li>Virement</li>
              <li>Paypal</li>
              <li>Alma : Payez jusqu’à 3 fois sans frais</li>
            </ul>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Contact -->
      <mj-section background-color="#ffffff" padding-bottom="25px" padding-top="40px" css-class="contact-wrap" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text">
        <mj-column width="15%" vertical-align="middle" padding="0" >
            <mj-image width="80px" src="mathilde.png" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="85%" vertical-align="middle"  padding="0">
          <mj-text align="left" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" padding-left="20px" padding-right="20px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text"  padding="0" font-style="italic">
            Si vous avez des questions, contactez Mathilde par téléphone au <span style="color:#36687E !important;">0 809 542 004</span> ou par email à <span style="color:#36687E !important;">contact@lemagasindubtp.com</span>.
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>
      
      <!-- Footer -->
      <mj-section background-color="#F3F3F3" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="40px" padding-left="31%"  padding-right="31%" css-class="footer-logo-wrap" >
        <mj-column width="33%" vertical-align="top" padding="0" >
          <mj-image href="https://www.facebook.com/leMAGASINduBTPcom-100184812275755/" width="30px" src="data:image/png;base64," />
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="33%" vertical-align="top" padding="0">
          <mj-image href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/lemagasindubtp/" width="30px" src="data:image/png;base64," />
        </mj-column>
        <mj-column width="33%" vertical-align="top" padding="0">
          <mj-image href="https://www.instagram.com/lemagasindubtp/" width="30px" src="data:image/png;base64," />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <mj-section background-color="#F3F3F3" padding-bottom="30px" padding-top="5px" >
        <mj-column width="100%" vertical-align="top" >
           <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text">
            leMAGASINduBTP.com - Tél. 0 809 542 004 <br> 51 rue des Grands Mortiers - 37700 - Saint-Pierre-des-Corps<br> SIRET 538 882 531 00022 - N° TVA intracommunautaire : FR 15 538 882 531
          </mj-text>
           <mj-text align="center" color="#000" font-weight="400" line-height="25px" font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" padding-left="50px" padding-right="50px" padding-bottom="0" padding-top="0" css-class="content-text">
            <a href="https://www.lemagasindubtp.com/conditions-generales-de-ventes-pour-les-particuliers" style=" color: #00add5 !important; text-decoration: underline; ">Conditions générales</a> | <a href="https://www.lemagasindubtp.com/politique-de-confidentialite-de-donnees" style=" color: #00add5 !important; text-decoration: underline; ">Politique de confidentialité</a> | <a href="https://www.lemagasindubtp.com/mentions-legales" style=" color: #00add5 !important; text-decoration: underline; ">Mentions légales</a>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

  </mj-body>
</mjml>
